   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Reheat the sauce until it sizzles, then add:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>the fried drumsticks</li><li>peanuts (or any nuts) <span class=\"amt\">~<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"145\">145 g</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"1\" data-alt=\"1\">1 cup</span>)</span></span></li><li>dried red chili, crushed <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tbsp</span></span></li><li>toasted sesame seeds <span class=\"amt\">~<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"70\">70 g</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"0.5\" data-alt=\"1\">½ cup</span>)</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Stir with a spatula until the sauce has mostly clung to the chicken. Turn off the heat.</li></ul>",
